  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>A hooded figure in dark leathers who says 'it's complicated' a great deal. Everyone at the table has played this character, or sat next to someone who did.</p><p><strong>Remnant.</strong> Max Hit Points, never rolled. It never attacks first. It cannot answer any question about its past that is not its Signature. It cannot leave a room by a door the party came through.</p>",
